Switch : Switch is multicast networking device work unders the data link layer of OSI Layer 2 and stores Mac address and connect bunch of computers in a same network and switch is a intelligent device and packet send on the same network it will be no Collison 

Router :  Router is a networking device works under the network layer of OSI Model layer 3 . and used to connect two or more different network 
